flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Review requirements and constraints]
    B --> C[Design architecture and diagrams]
    C --> D[Build Java domain model and interface]
    D --> E[Test with mock communication adapter]
    E --> F{Prototype requirements met?}
    F -- No --> G[Correct design or implementation]
    G --> D
    F -- Yes --> H[Integrate communication and optional services]
    H --> I[Controlled integration tests]
    I --> J[Document results and limitations]
    J --> K([Submission / review])
